findings.comment:
The following areas are in need of cleaning due to food debris and soil accumulation:
1) the floor drain near the pizza oven and pizza tray rack;
2) the floor in the area near the ice machine;
3) REPEAT: the floor in the dish area, especially under the dish machine (food and other debris; build up from sanitizer leak).
6-501.12: (A) PHYSICAL FACILITIES shall be cleaned as often as necessary to keep them clean. (B) Except for cleaning that is necessary due to a spill or other accident, cleaning shall be done during periods when the least amount of FOOD is exposed such as after closing. [C]

Lights are dim, burnt out, or bulbs are completely missing in the following areas:
1) over the pizza prep cooler;
2) in the ice machine area;
3) in front of the walk-in cooler door;
4) in the room/closet where the quat dispenser and utility sink are located.
Replace burnt out or missing lightbulbs to provide light throughout the kitchen.
6-303.11: The light intensity shall be at least a certain lux and present in certain areas. [C]
